build/
*.geode
# Was tracked at the repo root for a while (2026-08-26 through -27) so Juice
# could pull the latest build straight from GitHub without a Discord upload.
# Reverted 2026-08-27 -- the built .geode was already ~71MB with just two
# Big Brrr tracks bundled in, and kept growing every time a new resource got
# added; not sustainable against GitHub's 100MB hard per-file limit. Back to
# Discord for distributing builds.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.freebuff/

# Vendored FFmpeg binaries -- bundled into the packaged .geode for
# distribution (see mod.json's file list) but too large for GitHub (one DLL
# alone is over the 100MB hard limit) and don't benefit from version
# tracking anyway, since they're static third-party dependencies, not
# GucciBot's own source. Stripped from git history 2026-08-25 when this repo
# was first pushed; kept on disk so build_win.bat still works unchanged.
resources/ffmpeg.exe
resources/ffmpeg(1).exe
resources/ffmpeg_libs/avcodec-62.dll
resources/ffmpeg_libs/avfilter-11.dll
